source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A character behind the dash run leaves the item its text, so jiro keeps the run as text and escapes the dash JFM would read a break from.
-- input.jira --
* ----x
-- rendered.html --
<ul>
	<li>----x</li>
</ul>
-- want.md --
- \----x
-- warnings.json --
[]
